{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>Bezer in the wilderness.</b> As it is said: ״אדם עשוק בדם נפש עד בור ינוס״ etc. — that is, a person compelled to shed the blood of a soul, meaning one who killed unintentionally, unto the place of him concerning whom it is said ״וישב ראובן אל הבור״, shall flee to a refuge — that is, Bezer in the wilderness, for the Reubenites."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:30.403625482Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}